  "title": "Floating action",
  "group": "Actions",
  "order": 3,
  "summary": {
    "en": "One round accent button that floats over the content of a phone screen for the action people come to that screen to do (new message, add expense). It is the only resting control that casts a shadow.",
    "id": "Satu tombol bulat beraksen yang melayang di atas konten layar ponsel, untuk aksi yang menjadi alasan orang membuka layar itu (pesan baru, tambah pengeluaran). Hanya kontrol inilah yang memakai bayangan saat diam."
  },
  "titleId": "Floating action",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "On a phone list",
        "desc": "Floats over the scrolling list, above the tab bar. Press it to feel the sink.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-phone\">\n  <div class=\"docs-scroll\" style=\"height: 100%; padding: 20px 16px 120px;\">\n    <h3 class=\"section__title-sm\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Messages</h3>\n    <div class=\"list list--fill\">\n      <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 36px;\">RK</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Rina Kusuma</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Can the posyandu session move to 4?</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray\" style=\"--size: 36px;\">PK</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Puskesmas Kedaton</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">The immunization room moved to the 2nd floor</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 36px;\">AP</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Adi Pratama</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Sent photos of the damaged road report</span></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--accent\" aria-label=\"New message\" style=\"position: absolute; right: 20px; bottom: 28px; width: 56px; height: 56px; box-shadow: var(--finish-primary), var(--shadow-md);\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--accent\" aria-label=\"New message\"\n  style=\"position: fixed; right: 20px; bottom: calc(83px + 16px); width: 56px; height: 56px; box-shadow: var(--finish-primary), var(--shadow-md);\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>\n</button>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Di daftar ponsel",
        "desc": "Melayang di atas daftar yang menggulir, di atas tab bar. Tekan untuk merasakan efek tekannya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-phone\">\n  <div class=\"docs-scroll\" style=\"height: 100%; padding: 20px 16px 120px;\">\n    <h3 class=\"section__title-sm\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Pesan</h3>\n    <div class=\"list list--fill\">\n      <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 36px;\">RK</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Rina Kusuma</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Jadwal posyandu bisa dipindah ke jam 4?</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray\" style=\"--size: 36px;\">PK</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Puskesmas Kedaton</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Ruang imunisasi pindah ke lantai 2</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 36px;\">AP</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Adi Pratama</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Mengirim foto laporan jalan rusak</span></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--accent\" aria-label=\"Pesan baru\" style=\"position: absolute; right: 20px; bottom: 28px; width: 56px; height: 56px; box-shadow: var(--finish-primary), var(--shadow-md);\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--accent\" aria-label=\"Pesan baru\"\n  style=\"position: fixed; right: 20px; bottom: calc(83px + 16px); width: 56px; height: 56px; box-shadow: var(--finish-primary), var(--shadow-md);\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>\n</button>"
      }
    ]
  },
